WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Mutanena! Yau tarihi ne!

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.800
Na zama Baba — a hukumance!

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.200
Felix, don Allah — ni na ɗauki cikin wata
shida.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Zaɓen da na ci! Gagarumar nasara!

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Mama, muna da labari… Ada tana da ciki!
Wata shida!

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.800
Wata shida? Sai yau kuke gaya min?

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Mama, mun so mu tabbata komai lafiya
tukuna…

8
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.800
Tabbatar da me? Cewa na Felix ne?

9
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.500
Mama! Ah-ah! Mene ne wannan?!

10
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:43.000
Matar da ta zo yanzu, ta auri ɗana tilo —
yanzu ciki ya bayyana.

11
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.800
A wannan Lagos, dole mutum ya tambaya.

12
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.500
Mama, ina girmama ki. Wannan jaririn
jikanki ne.

13
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.600
Za mu gani. DNA za ta faɗa.

14
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.500
Masoyiya, ba haka take nufi ba… Mama 'yar
barkwanci ce.

15
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.800
Felix, kai kaɗai ne ɗan barkwanci a gidan
nan.

16
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Meow… Zuciyar Mama na zargi.

17
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.800
Babu wanda zai zagi ɗana.

18
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.800
Babu kowa. Na rantse. Ko da Mama ce.

19
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.500
Felix, ɗauki kayana. Daga yau, nan zan
zauna.

20
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.800
Ubangiji ya aiko ta… don ta sa ido.

21
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.500
Haka matsalar ta fara.
